<title>URUGUAY: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>URUGUAY GOVERNMENT LIST (961213)</p>
<p> President..............................Julio SANGUINETTI (PC)</p>
<p>(Sworn in 1 Mar 1995)</p>
<p> Vice-President.............................Hugo BATALLA (PGP)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>COALITION CABINET (Formed 15 Feb 95, Sworn in 1 Mar 95)</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Culture &amp; Education................Samuel LICHTENSZTEJN (PGP)</p>
<p> Defence.....................................Raul ITURRIA (PN)</p>
<p> Economy &amp; Finance.............................Luis MOSCA (PC)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.............................Alvaro RAMOS (PN)</p>
<p> Housing &amp; Environment......................Juan CHIRUCHI (PN)</p>
<p> Industry &amp; Energy.......................Federico SLINGER (UC)</p>
