<p> Labour &amp; Social Security................Ana Lia PINEYRUA (PN)</p>
<p> Livestock, Agriculture &amp; Fisheries.......Carlos GASPARRI (PC)</p>
<p> Public Health................................Jose SOLARI (PC)</p>
<p> Tourism.....................................Benito STERN (PC)</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Public Works...................Lucio CACERES (PC)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS</p>
<p>PN -  National Party (Partido Nacional) (&quot;Blanco&quot;)</p>
<p>PC -  Colorado Party (Partido Colorado)</p>
<p>PGP - People's Government Party (Partido por el Gobierno del</p>
<p>	 Pueblo)</p>
<p>UC -  Civic Union (Union Civica)</p>
